    "result_text": "The build passes. The only test class (`AcceptanceTest`) is green \u2014 the other two files are support classes (`AcceptanceBase`, `AuditLogCapture`).\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented customerCode de-duplication in `OwnerRestControllerV1.java`.\n\nThe `customerCodeFor(Owner)` method computes a base code of `<REGION>-<HASH8>`. I wrapped its return value in a new `deduplicateCustomerCode(String)` helper that:\n\n- Collects all existing owners' non-null `customerCode` values into a `Set`.\n- Returns the base code unchanged when no existing owner carries it.\n- Otherwise appends `-<n>`, starting at `n = 2` and incrementing until it finds a value no existing owner already has, then returns that de-duplicated code.\n\nI also added the `java.util.Objects`, `java.util.Set`, and `java.util.stream.Collectors` imports. The de-duplication runs before the new owner is persisted, so it only compares against pre-existing owners.\n\n`./mvnw test` \u2192 `BUILD SUCCESS`, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`.",
